    kind: work_item  # 50d4
    title: "No validator checks an id's language slot equals the node's own language (ADR-0036 Ruling 2); only 'is a known language' is checked, so a wrong-but-known slot passes"  # 50d4
    status: todo_hard  # 50d4
    priority: 3  # 50d4
